WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 17 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
Deep breath, son. You've got the heart. I know you'll ignite at least one rune.

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.680
Hell, with a little luck you might even crack the four orders.

3
00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:15.140
I miss the days when I only embarrassed myself at the academy.

4
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.700
Look at you.

5
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.300
Crawl back to the slopes and stop wasting our time.

6
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.140
Grand Duke, this peasant is about to wet himself.

7
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:29.460
Allow me to show him how it's done. This is how someone with Hero's blood

8
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:43.600
faces their destiny.

9
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.520
Guess the astrolab doesn't lie.

10
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.400
Flawless resonance. Absolute control over Frost.

11
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.080
A true prodigy.

12
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:55.840
My daughter is the youngest graduate in the Royal Academy's history.

13
00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:08.300
Her potential goes far beyond mere Frost.

14
00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:12.700
Are you seeing this, Father? I've surpassed you. Your seat is mine.

15
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:16.300
Another rare talent from the Balmont family.

16
00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:21.580
Caspian's luck is damagly persistent. This is becoming a serious problem.

17
00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.940
Caspian's newborn is a freak of nature.

18
00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:29.660
If he grows up, he'll threaten our absolute control over the four orders.

19
00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:36.800
Kill him in his crib, Jackson. I eliminated his freak of a son,

20
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:42.000
and now he brings in an adopted stray who can command four elements.

21
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.120
While I, in my entire life, have only mastered two.

22
00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.560
Duke Balmont was totally delusional trying to set us up.

23
00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:59.170
Look at that smirk. Lucian is completely hooked now.

24
00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:02.850
Beatrix Valmont. Your brilliance is irresistible to me.

25
00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.890
This pendant has been passed down through my family for generations.

26
00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:09.250
The only pair in the realm. Will you marry me?

27
00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:13.730
Lucian, this is such a big surprise. I'm honored.

28
00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:17.810
Lucian is an arrogant snake. I will never let him ruin my daughter.

29
00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:19.890
It has to be Aris.

30
00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:25.090
Beatrix, stop. Do not accept his wedding proposal.
